-- #849 fixture: line-number-or-symbol addressing for medaka_type_at and
-- medaka_definition.  `total total extra = total + extra` — is the star of
-- the show: `total` appears at cols 0, 6, 20 (param name, shadowing param,
-- and the addition operand — three matches, the ambiguous case) and `extra`
-- appears at cols 12, 28 (two matches).  `bump` below is unique on its own
-- line (the unambiguous single-match case) — named to
-- avoid colliding with the prelude's own `count` (core.mdk), which would
-- otherwise shadow this fixture's local binding and make the golden read as
-- a #849 bug when it's really an unrelated hover/shadowing quirk.  `missing`
-- never appears anywhere, exercising the absent-symbol hint.  (0-based line
-- numbers below are re-verified with `cat -n` — do not hand-count comments.)
total : Int -> Int -> Int
total total extra = total + extra

bump : Int -> Int
bump n = n + 1

main = println (total (bump 1) 2)
